{"script":"yd_015_06-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2","y":-474,"x":-120,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara015_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"y":-474,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara015_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]你问我是什么类型的魔人？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]看看我的鹿茸和蹄子，应该就能明白了吧。[r][l]不过，我理解你的困惑，毕竟不是所有魔人都能拥有这么夸张的特征。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]现在的这个姿态，是我长年修行德鲁伊之道，和黑森林之灵高度共鸣的结果。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]森林之灵让我们的收成丰裕，灵魂有了归处，而我们德鲁伊则以最诚挚的奉侍来回馈她。[r][l]这样的姿态，也是森林的一种赐福。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]换句话说……这就是黑森林和我们森林住民在这三百年中维持的宝贵和谐。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"芭杜尔-黑森林的住民1"}